{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017gGtixxmvQ57aY6RXZJdU2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for each experiment in the experiment_plan under the \"median\" tier definition. Let me identify all experiments from the plan and generate predicted results for each.\n\nLooking at the experiment plan, the experiments are:\n\n1. plan_001: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO (DONE)\n2. plan_002: DINO baseline RSA (DONE)\n3. plan_003: Per-layer RSA degradation curve (DONE)\n4. plan_004: Output head analysis (DONE)\n\n\n5. plan_005: 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks (orphaned)\n6. plan_006: Instruction ablation (DONE)\n7. plan_007: 2×2 matrix (DONE)\n8. plan_008: Random instruction control (DONE)\n9. plan_011: Functional action probe (orphaned)\n10. plan_012: CLIP-ViT pretraining control (planned)\n11. plan_009: CKA verification (DONE)\n12. plan_010: LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark (planned)\n\nI need to generate detailed predicted data for all of these experiments, focusing on the ones marked as DONE, orphaned, and planned.\n\nFor the median tier outcomes, I'm expecting CLIP-ViT RSA to land between 0.42-0.50, which sits above DINO but well below SigLIP. LIBERO-Spatial will likely show incomplete reproduction with effect sizes shrinking by 30-50%. The readout concentration should remain largely unaffected across claim 2/3, though at least one reviewer will probably raise concerns about whether these findings generalize beyond a single architecture. There's also a chance the CKA-RSA dissociation gets misinterpreted as a metric confusion issue rather than a genuine phenomenon.\n\nNow I'm looking at the specific metric ranges that define this tier—CLIP-ViT RSA capped at 0.50, LIBERO-Spatial with SigLIP reaching up to 0.58, training delta between 0.03-0.15, and readout delta constrained to 0.015-0.035, with reviewer scores clustering in the 4-6 range. I need to generate predicted data for all experiments in the plan, focusing especially on the planned and orphaned ones that don't have actual results yet, and explain why these values make sense under median-tier expectations.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":37475,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b49b86d8-f392-4543-b156-991db6c9e895","uuid":"f47f5716-f567-44f6-83c0-460785d157d8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017gGtixxmvQ57aY6RXZJdU2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 从 \"vision encoder dominance\" 软化为 \"VL-pretrained vision encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\"。\n  CLIP-ViT 落入中间地带（RSA ~0.46），高于 DINO（0.388）但显著低于 SigLIP（0.615），说明 VL pretraining 有贡献但 SigLIP 有额外优势（可能是 pretraining scale、objective design 或 data composition）。\n  LIBERO-Spatial 仅完成部分实验或 effect size 缩小 30-50%，Claim 1/3 需加 \"on LIBERO-Goal\" 限定。\n  Claim 2/3 的 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）作为最强证据前置为 headline result，不受影响。\n  论文重心从 \"where actions come from\" 调整为 \"what fine-tuning actually learns\"——Claim 3 (routing-not-creating) 为核心卖点，Claim 1 降为支撑性 finding。\n  Discussion 新增 \"pretraining recipe matters\" 段落，正面讨论 CLIP-ViT 中间结果的 implications。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"核心 RSA 三方对比，证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n      trained_with_inst_rsa: 0.501\n      untrained_with_inst_rsa: 0.485\n      trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.501\n      untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.480\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验，实际数据直接沿用。SigLIP RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 各条件（~0.48-0.50）和 DINO（0.388），\n      在 median 档下此结果本身不受挑战。但因 plan_012 CLIP-ViT 控制实验将揭示 SigLIP 优势部分来自 \n      encoder-specific 因素（而非纯 VL pretraining），Claim 1 需从 \"vision encoder dominance\" \n      软化为 \"VL-pretrained encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\"。\n      核心论点（action structure 源自 frozen encoder 而非 LLM fine-tuning）不变，但不能声称任意 \n      VL encoder 都能达到 SigLIP 水平。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: RSA with Action Structure (image_mean aggregation)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.615\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"VLA trained (with-inst)\", \"0.501\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA untrained (with-inst)\", \"0.485\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA trained (no-inst)\", \"0.501\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA untrained (no-inst)\", \"0.480\", \"Peak L29\"]\n          - [\"CLIP-ViT (plan_012)\", \"0.46\", \"Median tier prediction\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2\", \"0.388\", \"Vision-only baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: RSA values for 7 conditions, SigLIP >> CLIP-ViT > VLA band > DINO, 加 bootstrap 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      SigLIP 优势明确但在 median 档下需要 CLIP-ViT 数据来区分 \"VL pretraining 通用贡献\" vs \"SigLIP \n      specific 优势\"。CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 表明 VL pretraining 贡献约 0.07 RSA（0.46-0.388=DINO），\n      而 SigLIP 在此基础上额外贡献 0.155（0.615-0.46）。这迫使 Claim 1 承认 encoder choice matters。\n\n  - name: \"DINO baseline RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n      per_task_rho_mean: 0.901\n      action_probe_R2: 0.712\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。DINO RSA=0.388 作为 lower bound 在 median 档下更为重要：CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 \n      意味着 DINO-to-CLIP gap（0.07）远小于 CLIP-to-SigLIP gap（0.155），说明 VL pretraining \n      是必要条件但 SigLIP 的具体 recipe 贡献更大。同时 DINO action probe R²=0.712 ≈ Projector \n      0.706（p=0.22, n.s.）的发现在 median 档下成为关键区分论据：action information 的 presence \n      与 geometric alignment 是不同维度。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: RSA vs Action Probe R², 标注 DINO（高R²低RSA）vs SigLIP（高R²高RSA）dissociation\"\n    analysis: >\n      DINO 数据在 median 档下与 CLIP-ViT 共同支撑 \"pretraining recipe matters\" 论点。\n      DINO ≈ Projector in R² but << in RSA 的 dissociation 是核心 insight。\n\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的衰减轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      proj_to_l1_drop_range: [0.137, 0.253]\n      total_degradation: 0.13\n      pattern: \"non-monotonic with partial recovery in mid-layers\"\n      all_layers_above_dino: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Proj→L1 drop 20-40% 的 non-monotonic pattern 在 median 档下不受挑战。\n      此 curve 对 median 档叙事有额外价值：即使 LLM 降解 geometric alignment，所有层 RSA \n      仍 >> DINO（0.388），说明 SigLIP 的 geometric structure 虽被衰减但未被摧毁。这支撑 \n      \"VL pretraining 注入的结构具有 robustness\" 的 discussion point。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA summary\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Proj→L1 Drop\"]\n          - [\"trained with-inst\", \"0.488\", \"L9\", \"0.204\"]\n          - [\"untrained with-inst\", \"0.485\", \"L12\", \"0.151\"]\n          - [\"trained no-inst\", \"0.489\", \"L30\", \"0.253\"]\n          - [\"untrained no-inst\", \"0.480\", \"L6\", \"0.137\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 4 conditions × 33 layers, SigLIP projector 水平线 (0.615) 和 DINO 水平线 (0.388) 作为参照\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-layer curve 稳定，median 档不影响此结果。在 rebuttal 中可作为 mechanical evidence \n      支撑 \"LLM as information router\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Output head analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      vision_cos_sim: 1.0\n      projector_cos_sim: 1.0\n      llm_mean_rel_change: 1.316\n      llm_cos_sim: 0.218\n      head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Vision backbone + Projector 完全 frozen（cos_sim=1.0）是 Claims 1-3 的结构性 \n      前提。在 median 档下此结果 critical：它解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained in representation \n      structure——因为 action-relevant structure 的源头（SigLIP+projector）在 training 中完全 \n      不变。LLM 权重变化均匀分布（1.22-1.37）而非 head-concentrated，说明 fine-tuning 是 \n      distributed adaptation 而非 shallow head tuning。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: parameter group × (rel_change, cos_sim), vision/projector 显示 IDENTICAL\"\n    analysis: >\n      此结果在所有档位都成立，为 \"routing-not-creating\" 提供 architectural grounding。\n\n  - name: \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across multiple methods\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_methods_consistent: true\n      trained_approx_untrained: true\n      both_above_dino: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Orphaned 状态但已由 plan_001/006/007/008/011/009 的各独立实验覆盖。在 median 档下，\n      核心发现 \"trained ≈ untrained\" 来自 image_mean RSA（bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20）\n      和 functional probe（image_mean R² gap 稳定）。单独的 6-method 矩阵不影响 median 档 \n      判断。如果 reviewer 质疑 method coverage，已有 RSA + CKA + functional probe + \n      bootstrap CI 四重交叉验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验的核心发现已由其他实验独立覆盖。Median 档下 reviewer 更可能质疑 \n      single-architecture 而非 method coverage。\n\n  - name: \"Instruction ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\"\n    expected_results:\n      delta_with_minus_no_inst: 0.004\n      no_inst_untrained_rsa: 0.480\n      instruction_effect: \"negligible\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Δ=0.004 远低于任何合理阈值。在 median 档下此结果与 plan_008（random/shuffled \n      instruction）共同构成三重不变性证据（training × instruction presence × instruction content），\n      这是 Claim 3 最完备的支撑之一且不受 median 档的 confound 影响。与 Hou 2026 LangGap / \n      Fei 2025 LIBERO-Plus 的 behavioral finding（VLAs ignore language）形成 representation-level \n      解释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction invariance 是 Claim 3 最 robust 的子发现，median 档完全不影响。\n\n  - name: \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"四条件全收敛验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_cells_range: [0.480, 0.501]\n      bootstrap_ci: \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\"\n      training_effect_p: 0.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。四条件收敛于 0.48-0.50 band 是 Claim 3（training invariance of distributed \n      representations）的核心证据。Bootstrap CI 包含 0、p=0.20 表明 training effect 在统计上 \n      不显著。在 median 档下此结果与 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）形成鲜明对比——\n      这正是 \"routing-not-creating\" 叙事的关键 dissociation：distributed structure 不变 \n      但 readout 集中度训练依赖。此 contrast 在 median 档下作为 headline result 前置。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 2: 2×2 Training × Instruction RSA Matrix (image_mean)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"\", \"With Instruction\", \"No Instruction\"]\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.501\", \"0.501\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"0.485\", \"0.480\"]\n          - [\"Bootstrap Δ CI\", \"[-0.058, 0.072]\", \"p=0.20\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap with values, 色彩饱和度映射 RSA，视觉上强调四格近似\"\n    analysis: >\n      此 2×2 matrix 是论文 Figure 2 或 3 的核心。Median 档下配合 readout concentration \n      对比使用效果最强。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"随机/无意义 instruction 验证 content 不影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      normal_rsa: 0.489\n      random_rsa: 0.484\n      shuffled_rsa: 0.483\n      empty_rsa: 0.472\n      max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n      instruction_invariant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）RSA 在 ±0.017 内，\n      排除 trivial separability 攻击面。在 median 档下此结果关闭了 \"instruction content \n      可能通过 representation 影响 action\" 的假说——所有变异性 << training effect（本身就 \n      不显著, p=0.20），更 << SigLIP→LLM degradation（0.114）。三重不变性完备。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S2: Instruction Content Invariance\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Δ vs Normal\"]\n          - [\"Normal instruction\", \"0.489\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random words\", \"0.484\", \"-0.005\"]\n          - [\"Shuffled tokens\", \"0.483\", \"-0.006\"]\n          - [\"Empty string\", \"0.472\", \"-0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 instruction conditions, error bars, 虚线标注 ±0.017 band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Empty 略低（-0.017）可能反映 token sequence length 对 attention pattern 的微弱影响，\n      但量级远不足以影响任何 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Functional action probe (v2 with bootstrap + DINO three-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Projector / LLM / DINO 功能性对比，bootstrap CI\"\n    expected_results:\n      projector_R2: 0.706\n      image_mean_trained_L19_R2: 0.683\n      last_preaction_trained_L19_R2: 0.731\n      untrained_image_mean_L0_R2: 0.714\n      untrained_last_preaction_L32_R2: 0.686\n      dino_R2: 0.712\n      bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_p: 0.001\n      bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_ci: [0.011, 0.037]\n      readout_concentration_delta: 0.045\n      readout_concentration_p: 0.0001\n      readout_concentration_ci: [0.032, 0.058]\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成（orphaned 但各子实验均 DONE）。在 median 档下此结果是最强证据：\n\n      (1) Readout concentration（trained 0.731 >> untrained 0.686, Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）\n      完全不受 CLIP-ViT confound 和 LIBERO-Spatial 延迟影响，因为它测量的是 LLM internal \n      routing behavior 而非 encoder quality。\n\n      (2) Three-way ordering DINO(0.712) ≈ Proj(0.706) > LLM image_mean(0.683) 在 \n      median 档下成为关键 nuance：action information 的 presence 是 encoder-agnostic 的 \n      （DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²），但 geometric alignment（RSA）是 encoder-specific 的。\n      这支撑 median 档的论文叙事调整——从 \"where actions come from\" 到 \"what fine-tuning \n      actually learns\"。\n\n      (3) Untrained readout 0.686 < projector 0.706 证明 redistribution 需要 training，\n      这是 \"routing is learned\" 的 smoking gun，且在 median 档下作为 headline result \n      前置不受任何 confound 影响。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 3: Functional Action Probe R² (LIBERO-Goal)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Model/Condition\", \"mean R²\", \"vs Projector\", \"p-value\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.706\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Trained image_mean L19\", \"0.683\", \"-0.023\", \"0.001\"]\n          - [\"Trained last_preaction L19\", \"0.731\", \"+0.025\", \"0.001\"]\n          - [\"Untrained image_mean L0\", \"0.714\", \"+0.008\", \"n.s.\"]\n          - [\"Untrained last_preaction L32\", \"0.686\", \"-0.020\", \"<0.0001 vs trained\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.712\", \"+0.006\", \"0.22 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Bar chart with bootstrap CI, 双面箭头标注 trained vs untrained readout Δ=0.045\"\n      - \"Figure 3 inset: R² vs RSA scatter，标注 functional-geometric dissociation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Readout concentration 是 median 档论文的核心卖点。此 Δ=0.045 (p<0.0001) 与 \n      image_mean RSA Δ=0.02 (p=0.20) 的 contrast 完美支撑 \"routing-not-creating\"：\n      training 改变 information flow 但不改变 distributed structure。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 通用贡献 vs SigLIP-specific 优势\"\n    expected_results:\n      clip_vit_rsa_image_mean: 0.46\n      clip_vit_rsa_95ci: [0.38, 0.54]\n      clip_vit_rsa_per_task_range: [0.35, 0.58]\n      clip_vit_action_probe_R2: 0.695\n      clip_vit_action_delta_R2: 0.110\n      clip_vit_vs_dino_rsa_delta: 0.072\n      clip_vit_vs_siglip_rsa_delta: -0.155\n      clip_vit_vs_projector_probe_delta: -0.011\n      ordering_rsa: \"SigLIP (0.615) >> CLIP-ViT (0.46) > DINO (0.388)\"\n      ordering_R2: \"DINO (0.712) ≈ Proj (0.706) ≈ CLIP-ViT (0.695) > LLM img_mean (0.683)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：CLIP-ViT RSA 落入 0.42-0.50 中间地带。\n\n      为什么 RSA ~0.46（高于 DINO 但低于 SigLIP）：\n      - CLIP-ViT（ViT-L/14, 400M params）与 DINO 共享 pure vision architecture，\n        但 CLIP 的 contrastive image-text pretraining 赋予了部分 language-aligned geometric \n        structure，使其 RSA 高于 self-supervised DINO（0.388）。\n      - 然而 SigLIP 相比 CLIP 有三个关键差异：(a) sigmoid loss vs softmax loss——SigLIP \n        的 pairwise sigmoid 更好地保留 fine-grained distance structure；(b) training \n        data scale（WebLI vs WIT/LAION）；(c) 可能的 architecture tuning。这些差异解释了 \n        SigLIP 额外的 0.155 RSA 优势。\n      - Action probe R² ~0.695 与 SigLIP projector（0.706）接近但略低，说明 VL pretraining \n        的 contribution 主要在 geometric alignment（RSA）而非 raw information content（R²），\n        与 DINO ≈ Projector in R² 的发现一致。\n\n      此结果的 implication：\n      - Claim 1 必须限定：不是所有 VL-pretrained encoder 都达到 SigLIP 水平的 geometric \n        alignment。存在 encoder hierarchy：SigLIP > CLIP > DINO。\n      - 但核心论点不变：即使 RSA=0.46 的 CLIP-ViT，其 geometric alignment 仍高于 VLA \n        各条件（0.48-0.50 LLM degrades it further），且远高于 DINO。\n      - \"Pretraining recipe matters\" 是新增 discussion point，不是对 core claims 的否定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Pretraining Control — CLIP-ViT vs SigLIP vs DINO\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Encoder\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Pretraining\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP-SO400M\", \"0.615\", \"0.706\", \"Sigmoid image-text (WebLI)\"]\n          - [\"CLIP ViT-L/14\", \"0.46\", \"0.695\", \"Softmax image-text (WIT/LAION)\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 ViT-L\", \"0.388\", \"0.712\", \"Self-supervised (LVD-142M)\"]\n      - title: \"Table 4b: Decomposition of VL-pretraining contribution\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Comparison\", \"ΔRSA\", \"ΔR²\", \"Interpretation\"]\n          - [\"CLIP - DINO\", \"+0.072\", \"-0.017\", \"VL pretraining adds geometric alignment, not information\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP - CLIP\", \"+0.155\", \"+0.011\", \"SigLIP recipe adds both alignment and information\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP - DINO\", \"+0.227\", \"-0.006\", \"Total VL advantage is geometric, not functional\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: 2D scatter (RSA × R²)，三个 encoder 标注 + VLA 各条件，虚线标注 CLIP-ViT 的中间位置\"\n      - \"Figure 4b: Bar chart decomposing RSA gap: DINO→CLIP (+0.07) + CLIP→SigLIP (+0.155)\"\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP-ViT 中间结果在 median 档下是 double-edged sword：\n\n      正面：(1) 确认 VL pretraining 有贡献（CLIP > DINO in RSA），支撑 \"VL pretraining \n      matters\" 叙事。(2) R² 三者接近进一步强化 geometric-functional dissociation finding。\n      (3) 为 \"pretraining recipe matters\" discussion 提供具体数据点。\n\n      负面：(1) SigLIP 优势部分来自 encoder-specific 因素，削弱 \"VL pretraining is the key\" \n      的通用性声明。(2) 至少一位 reviewer 会质疑：如果换成 CLIP-ViT，VLA 的 action structure \n      会怎样变化？需要 rebuttal 准备 CLIP-ViT as VLA backbone 的讨论（即使不做实验）。\n\n      Rebuttal 策略：将 CLIP-ViT 结果定位为 \"partial support + new insight\"——VL pretraining \n      是 necessary but not sufficient condition for strong geometric alignment，SigLIP \n      recipe 的具体优势值得 future work 深入研究。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检查指标依赖性\"\n    expected_results:\n      linear_cka_ordering: \"untrained (0.089) > trained (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\"\n      rdm_cka_ordering: \"trained (0.260) ≈ projector (0.257) > untrained (0.246) > DINO (0.241)\"\n      cka_last_preaction: 0.127\n      rsa_cka_ordering_reversal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。在 median 档下此结果面临额外挑战：至少一位 reviewer 将 CKA-RSA dissociation \n      视为 metric confusion 而非 finding。\n\n      为什么 CKA 和 RSA 排序反转：\n      - RSA 测量 pairwise distance structure 的 rank correlation——local geometric alignment。\n        LLM 的 nonlinear transformation 打乱了 pairwise distances 的 rank order，降低 RSA。\n      - CKA 测量 centered kernel alignment——global subspace overlap。LLM 保留甚至增强了 \n        global variance structure（特别是 CKA 单调上升 L0→L32），因为 attention 操作虽然 \n        重排 pairwise distances 但保留了 principal variation directions。\n      - 这不是 \"metric confusion\"——两个指标测量不同 aspects of representational similarity，\n        dissociation 本身是 informative 的。但 median 档的 reviewer 可能不接受这个区分。\n\n      Rebuttal 准备：\n      - 明确定义 \"geometric alignment\" (RSA) vs \"structural preservation\" (CKA)\n      - 引用 Kornblith et al. 2019 和 Shahbazi et al. 2021 对两指标 sensitivity 差异的分析\n      - 强调 Claim 2 已限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"，不泛化为 \"representation quality\"\n      - CKA last_preaction=0.127 >> image_mean 0.08x 支撑 redistribution，与 RSA 一致\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S3: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Ordering\", \"Interpretation\"]\n          - [\"RSA\", \"Proj > Trained > Untrained > DINO\", \"Geometric alignment with action space\"]\n          - [\"Linear CKA\", \"Untrained > Trained > Proj > DINO\", \"Global structure preservation\"]\n          - [\"RDM-CKA\", \"Trained ≈ Proj > Untrained > DINO\", \"Hybrid (distance-based CKA)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure S2: 双 y-axis plot (RSA left, CKA right) across conditions, 标注 ordering reversal\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档下需在 main text Discussion 正面讨论此 dissociation（不能只放 supplementary）。\n      一位 reviewer 的 \"metric confusion\" 评价需正面回应：dissociation 恰恰说明 LLM 对 \n      representation 的变换是 selective 的——降解 local geometry 但保留 global structure——\n      这对理解 LLM 的 representation processing 有独立价值。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证所有 Claims\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.52\n      siglip_projector_rsa_95ci: [0.45, 0.58]\n      trained_image_mean_rsa_peak: 0.42\n      trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 19\n      untrained_image_mean_rsa_peak: 0.40\n      untrained_image_mean_peak_layer: 23\n      dino_rsa: 0.32\n      training_effect_delta: 0.02\n      training_effect_p: 0.08\n      training_effect_significant: false\n      readout_trained_R2: 0.68\n      readout_untrained_R2: 0.655\n      readout_delta: 0.025\n      readout_delta_ci: [0.015, 0.035]\n      readout_delta_p: 0.01\n      action_probe_projector_R2: 0.65\n      action_probe_llm_image_mean_R2: 0.62\n      ordering_preserved: true\n      effect_size_reduction: \"35-45%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：LIBERO-Spatial 未完成或部分复现，effect size 缩小 30-50%。\n\n      为什么 effect size 缩小：\n      - LIBERO-Spatial 的 action structure 比 LIBERO-Goal 更 spatially grounded——task \n        差异主要在 spatial prepositions（\"to the left of\", \"in front of\"）而非 object \n        identity。SigLIP 的 image-text pretraining 对 spatial relationships 的 encoding \n        不如对 object-level semantics 那么强，因此 RSA 从 0.615 降至 ~0.52。\n      - Training effect 在 LIBERO-Spatial 上 p=0.08（边缘），因为 spatial tasks 的 action \n        variability 更高，增加了 bootstrap sampling 的 variance。但 CI 仍然覆盖 0 或 \n        接近覆盖 0，不改变 Claim 3 的方向性结论。\n      - Readout concentration Δ=0.025（vs LIBERO-Goal 0.045）缩小约 44%，但仍显著 \n        (p=0.01)。缩小原因：spatial tasks 的 action prediction 难度更高，readout \n        concentration 的 ceiling effect 降低。\n      - DINO RSA 也降至 0.32（vs 0.388 on LIBERO-Goal），说明 spatial tasks 对所有 \n        encoder 都更难 align。\n\n      此结果的 implication：\n      - 所有三个 Claims 的 ordering 保持（SigLIP > VLA > DINO; trained ≈ untrained in \n        distributed; trained > untrained in readout），但 effect size 一致缩小。\n      - 论文需在所有 Claims 加 \"on LIBERO-Goal\" 限定，LIBERO-Spatial 作为 partial \n        replication 放在 supplementary 或 discussion。\n      - 如果 deadline 前未完成：rebuttal 中 promise LIBERO-Spatial 初步结果，附现有 \n        extraction pipeline 的进度证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S4: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"RSA (Spatial)\", \"RSA (Goal)\", \"Reduction\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.52\", \"0.615\", \"-15%\"]\n          - [\"Trained image_mean\", \"0.42\", \"0.501\", \"-16%\"]\n          - [\"Untrained image_mean\", \"0.40\", \"0.485\", \"-18%\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2\", \"0.32\", \"0.388\", \"-18%\"]\n          - [\"Training Δ\", \"0.02 (p=0.08)\", \"0.02 (p=0.20)\", \"direction consistent\"]\n      - title: \"Table S5: Readout Concentration Cross-Benchmark\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Reduction\"]\n          - [\"Trained readout R²\", \"0.68\", \"0.731\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"Untrained readout R²\", \"0.655\", \"0.686\", \"-5%\"]\n          - [\"Δ (trained-untrained)\", \"0.025\", \"0.045\", \"-44%\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.01\", \"<0.0001\", \"still significant\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure S3: Side-by-side bar charts LIBERO-Goal vs LIBERO-Spatial, 所有条件 paired comparison\"\n      - \"Figure S4: Readout concentration comparison across benchmarks with bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 部分复现在 median 档下是可接受的：ordering 保持证明 findings 非 \n      benchmark-specific artifact，effect size 缩小说明 task characteristics（spatial vs \n      object-centric）调节了具体 magnitude。这实际上增加了论文的 nuance 和 ecological \n      validity。\n\n      关键 rebuttal 点：effect size 缩小是 expected 的（spatial relationships 更难），\n      ordering preservation 才是 generalizability 的 test。如果连 ordering 都不保持 \n      那才是 real concern。\n\n      如果未完成：在 paper Discussion 加 \"ongoing cross-benchmark validation\" 一段，\n      rebuttal letter 提供 extraction pipeline 进度 + 初步 RSA numbers。Reviewer \n      通常接受 \"data in preparation\" 如果方向一致且 pipeline 可信。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_read_input_tokens":37475,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b49b86d8-f392-4543-b156-991db6c9e895","uuid":"edb3c884-fccf-473d-9968-07d0ad3e55fa"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":209841,"duration_api_ms":211531,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 从 \"vision encoder dominance\" 软化为 \"VL-pretrained vision encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\"。\n  CLIP-ViT 落入中间地带（RSA ~0.46），高于 DINO（0.388）但显著低于 SigLIP（0.615），说明 VL pretraining 有贡献但 SigLIP 有额外优势（可能是 pretraining scale、objective design 或 data composition）。\n  LIBERO-Spatial 仅完成部分实验或 effect size 缩小 30-50%，Claim 1/3 需加 \"on LIBERO-Goal\" 限定。\n  Claim 2/3 的 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）作为最强证据前置为 headline result，不受影响。\n  论文重心从 \"where actions come from\" 调整为 \"what fine-tuning actually learns\"——Claim 3 (routing-not-creating) 为核心卖点，Claim 1 降为支撑性 finding。\n  Discussion 新增 \"pretraining recipe matters\" 段落，正面讨论 CLIP-ViT 中间结果的 implications。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"核心 RSA 三方对比，证明 action-relevant 结构源自 frozen vision encoder\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n      trained_with_inst_rsa: 0.501\n      untrained_with_inst_rsa: 0.485\n      trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.501\n      untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.480\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验，实际数据直接沿用。SigLIP RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 各条件（~0.48-0.50）和 DINO（0.388），\n      在 median 档下此结果本身不受挑战。但因 plan_012 CLIP-ViT 控制实验将揭示 SigLIP 优势部分来自 \n      encoder-specific 因素（而非纯 VL pretraining），Claim 1 需从 \"vision encoder dominance\" \n      软化为 \"VL-pretrained encoder dominance, with SigLIP showing strongest alignment\"。\n      核心论点（action structure 源自 frozen encoder 而非 LLM fine-tuning）不变，但不能声称任意 \n      VL encoder 都能达到 SigLIP 水平。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: RSA with Action Structure (image_mean aggregation)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.615\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"VLA trained (with-inst)\", \"0.501\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA untrained (with-inst)\", \"0.485\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA trained (no-inst)\", \"0.501\", \"Peak L23\"]\n          - [\"VLA untrained (no-inst)\", \"0.480\", \"Peak L29\"]\n          - [\"CLIP-ViT (plan_012)\", \"0.46\", \"Median tier prediction\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2\", \"0.388\", \"Vision-only baseline\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: RSA values for 7 conditions, SigLIP >> CLIP-ViT > VLA band > DINO, 加 bootstrap 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      SigLIP 优势明确但在 median 档下需要 CLIP-ViT 数据来区分 \"VL pretraining 通用贡献\" vs \"SigLIP \n      specific 优势\"。CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 表明 VL pretraining 贡献约 0.07 RSA（0.46-0.388=DINO），\n      而 SigLIP 在此基础上额外贡献 0.155（0.615-0.46）。这迫使 Claim 1 承认 encoder choice matters。\n\n  - name: \"DINO baseline RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"Standalone vision model 参照基线\"\n    expected_results:\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n      per_task_rho_mean: 0.901\n      action_probe_R2: 0.712\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。DINO RSA=0.388 作为 lower bound 在 median 档下更为重要：CLIP-ViT RSA ~0.46 \n      意味着 DINO-to-CLIP gap（0.07）远小于 CLIP-to-SigLIP gap（0.155），说明 VL pretraining \n      是必要条件但 SigLIP 的具体 recipe 贡献更大。同时 DINO action probe R²=0.712 ≈ Projector \n      0.706（p=0.22, n.s.）的发现在 median 档下成为关键区分论据：action information 的 presence \n      与 geometric alignment 是不同维度。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: RSA vs Action Probe R², 标注 DINO（高R²低RSA）vs SigLIP（高R²高RSA）dissociation\"\n    analysis: >\n      DINO 数据在 median 档下与 CLIP-ViT 共同支撑 \"pretraining recipe matters\" 论点。\n      DINO ≈ Projector in R² but << in RSA 的 dissociation 是核心 insight。\n\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的衰减轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      proj_to_l1_drop_range: [0.137, 0.253]\n      total_degradation: 0.13\n      pattern: \"non-monotonic with partial recovery in mid-layers\"\n      all_layers_above_dino: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Proj→L1 drop 20-40% 的 non-monotonic pattern 在 median 档下不受挑战。\n      此 curve 对 median 档叙事有额外价值：即使 LLM 降解 geometric alignment，所有层 RSA \n      仍 >> DINO（0.388），说明 SigLIP 的 geometric structure 虽被衰减但未被摧毁。这支撑 \n      \"VL pretraining 注入的结构具有 robustness\" 的 discussion point。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA summary\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Proj→L1 Drop\"]\n          - [\"trained with-inst\", \"0.488\", \"L9\", \"0.204\"]\n          - [\"untrained with-inst\", \"0.485\", \"L12\", \"0.151\"]\n          - [\"trained no-inst\", \"0.489\", \"L30\", \"0.253\"]\n          - [\"untrained no-inst\", \"0.480\", \"L6\", \"0.137\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 4 conditions × 33 layers, SigLIP projector 水平线 (0.615) 和 DINO 水平线 (0.388) 作为参照\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-layer curve 稳定，median 档不影响此结果。在 rebuttal 中可作为 mechanical evidence \n      支撑 \"LLM as information router\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Output head analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      vision_cos_sim: 1.0\n      projector_cos_sim: 1.0\n      llm_mean_rel_change: 1.316\n      llm_cos_sim: 0.218\n      head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Vision backbone + Projector 完全 frozen（cos_sim=1.0）是 Claims 1-3 的结构性 \n      前提。在 median 档下此结果 critical：它解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained in representation \n      structure——因为 action-relevant structure 的源头（SigLIP+projector）在 training 中完全 \n      不变。LLM 权重变化均匀分布（1.22-1.37）而非 head-concentrated，说明 fine-tuning 是 \n      distributed adaptation 而非 shallow head tuning。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: parameter group × (rel_change, cos_sim), vision/projector 显示 IDENTICAL\"\n    analysis: >\n      此结果在所有档位都成立，为 \"routing-not-creating\" 提供 architectural grounding。\n\n  - name: \"6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"系统性验证 trained ≈ untrained across multiple methods\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_methods_consistent: true\n      trained_approx_untrained: true\n      both_above_dino: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Orphaned 状态但已由 plan_001/006/007/008/011/009 的各独立实验覆盖。在 median 档下，\n      核心发现 \"trained ≈ untrained\" 来自 image_mean RSA（bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20）\n      和 functional probe（image_mean R² gap 稳定）。单独的 6-method 矩阵不影响 median 档 \n      判断。如果 reviewer 质疑 method coverage，已有 RSA + CKA + functional probe + \n      bootstrap CI 四重交叉验证。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      此实验的核心发现已由其他实验独立覆盖。Median 档下 reviewer 更可能质疑 \n      single-architecture 而非 method coverage。\n\n  - name: \"Instruction ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化\"\n    expected_results:\n      delta_with_minus_no_inst: 0.004\n      no_inst_untrained_rsa: 0.480\n      instruction_effect: \"negligible\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。Δ=0.004 远低于任何合理阈值。在 median 档下此结果与 plan_008（random/shuffled \n      instruction）共同构成三重不变性证据（training × instruction presence × instruction content），\n      这是 Claim 3 最完备的支撑之一且不受 median 档的 confound 影响。与 Hou 2026 LangGap / \n      Fei 2025 LIBERO-Plus 的 behavioral finding（VLAs ignore language）形成 representation-level \n      解释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction invariance 是 Claim 3 最 robust 的子发现，median 档完全不影响。\n\n  - name: \"2×2 matrix (training × instruction)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"四条件全收敛验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_cells_range: [0.480, 0.501]\n      bootstrap_ci: \"[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0\"\n      training_effect_p: 0.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。四条件收敛于 0.48-0.50 band 是 Claim 3（training invariance of distributed \n      representations）的核心证据。Bootstrap CI 包含 0、p=0.20 表明 training effect 在统计上 \n      不显著。在 median 档下此结果与 readout concentration（Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）形成鲜明对比——\n      这正是 \"routing-not-creating\" 叙事的关键 dissociation：distributed structure 不变 \n      但 readout 集中度训练依赖。此 contrast 在 median 档下作为 headline result 前置。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 2: 2×2 Training × Instruction RSA Matrix (image_mean)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"\", \"With Instruction\", \"No Instruction\"]\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.501\", \"0.501\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"0.485\", \"0.480\"]\n          - [\"Bootstrap Δ CI\", \"[-0.058, 0.072]\", \"p=0.20\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap with values, 色彩饱和度映射 RSA，视觉上强调四格近似\"\n    analysis: >\n      此 2×2 matrix 是论文 Figure 2 或 3 的核心。Median 档下配合 readout concentration \n      对比使用效果最强。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"随机/无意义 instruction 验证 content 不影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      normal_rsa: 0.489\n      random_rsa: 0.484\n      shuffled_rsa: 0.483\n      empty_rsa: 0.472\n      max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n      instruction_invariant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）RSA 在 ±0.017 内，\n      排除 trivial separability 攻击面。在 median 档下此结果关闭了 \"instruction content \n      可能通过 representation 影响 action\" 的假说——所有变异性 << training effect（本身就 \n      不显著, p=0.20），更 << SigLIP→LLM degradation（0.114）。三重不变性完备。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S2: Instruction Content Invariance\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Δ vs Normal\"]\n          - [\"Normal instruction\", \"0.489\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random words\", \"0.484\", \"-0.005\"]\n          - [\"Shuffled tokens\", \"0.483\", \"-0.006\"]\n          - [\"Empty string\", \"0.472\", \"-0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 4 instruction conditions, error bars, 虚线标注 ±0.017 band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Empty 略低（-0.017）可能反映 token sequence length 对 attention pattern 的微弱影响，\n      但量级远不足以影响任何 claim。\n\n  - name: \"Functional action probe (v2 with bootstrap + DINO three-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Projector / LLM / DINO 功能性对比，bootstrap CI\"\n    expected_results:\n      projector_R2: 0.706\n      image_mean_trained_L19_R2: 0.683\n      last_preaction_trained_L19_R2: 0.731\n      untrained_image_mean_L0_R2: 0.714\n      untrained_last_preaction_L32_R2: 0.686\n      dino_R2: 0.712\n      bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_p: 0.001\n      bootstrap_proj_vs_image_mean_ci: [0.011, 0.037]\n      readout_concentration_delta: 0.045\n      readout_concentration_p: 0.0001\n      readout_concentration_ci: [0.032, 0.058]\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成（orphaned 但各子实验均 DONE）。在 median 档下此结果是最强证据：\n\n      (1) Readout concentration（trained 0.731 >> untrained 0.686, Δ=0.045, p<0.0001）\n      完全不受 CLIP-ViT confound 和 LIBERO-Spatial 延迟影响，因为它测量的是 LLM internal \n      routing behavior 而非 encoder quality。\n\n      (2) Three-way ordering DINO(0.712) ≈ Proj(0.706) > LLM image_mean(0.683) 在 \n      median 档下成为关键 nuance：action information 的 presence 是 encoder-agnostic 的 \n      （DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²），但 geometric alignment（RSA）是 encoder-specific 的。\n      这支撑 median 档的论文叙事调整——从 \"where actions come from\" 到 \"what fine-tuning \n      actually learns\"。\n\n      (3) Untrained readout 0.686 < projector 0.706 证明 redistribution 需要 training，\n      这是 \"routing is learned\" 的 smoking gun，且在 median 档下作为 headline result \n      前置不受任何 confound 影响。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 3: Functional Action Probe R² (LIBERO-Goal)\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Model/Condition\", \"mean R²\", \"vs Projector\", \"p-value\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.706\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Trained image_mean L19\", \"0.683\", \"-0.023\", \"0.001\"]\n          - [\"Trained last_preaction L19\", \"0.731\", \"+0.025\", \"0.001\"]\n          - [\"Untrained image_mean L0\", \"0.714\", \"+0.008\", \"n.s.\"]\n          - [\"Untrained last_preaction L32\", \"0.686\", \"-0.020\", \"<0.0001 vs trained\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.712\", \"+0.006\", \"0.22 (n.s.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Bar chart with bootstrap CI, 双面箭头标注 trained vs untrained readout Δ=0.045\"\n      - \"Figure 3 inset: R² vs RSA scatter，标注 functional-geometric dissociation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Readout concentration 是 median 档论文的核心卖点。此 Δ=0.045 (p<0.0001) 与 \n      image_mean RSA Δ=0.02 (p=0.20) 的 contrast 完美支撑 \"routing-not-creating\"：\n      training 改变 information flow 但不改变 distributed structure。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT pretraining control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 通用贡献 vs SigLIP-specific 优势\"\n    expected_results:\n      clip_vit_rsa_image_mean: 0.46\n      clip_vit_rsa_95ci: [0.38, 0.54]\n      clip_vit_rsa_per_task_range: [0.35, 0.58]\n      clip_vit_action_probe_R2: 0.695\n      clip_vit_action_delta_R2: 0.110\n      clip_vit_vs_dino_rsa_delta: 0.072\n      clip_vit_vs_siglip_rsa_delta: -0.155\n      clip_vit_vs_projector_probe_delta: -0.011\n      ordering_rsa: \"SigLIP (0.615) >> CLIP-ViT (0.46) > DINO (0.388)\"\n      ordering_R2: \"DINO (0.712) ≈ Proj (0.706) ≈ CLIP-ViT (0.695) > LLM img_mean (0.683)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：CLIP-ViT RSA 落入 0.42-0.50 中间地带。\n\n      为什么 RSA ~0.46（高于 DINO 但低于 SigLIP）：\n      - CLIP-ViT（ViT-L/14, 400M params）与 DINO 共享 pure vision architecture，\n        但 CLIP 的 contrastive image-text pretraining 赋予了部分 language-aligned geometric \n        structure，使其 RSA 高于 self-supervised DINO（0.388）。\n      - 然而 SigLIP 相比 CLIP 有三个关键差异：(a) sigmoid loss vs softmax loss——SigLIP \n        的 pairwise sigmoid 更好地保留 fine-grained distance structure；(b) training \n        data scale（WebLI vs WIT/LAION）；(c) 可能的 architecture tuning。这些差异解释了 \n        SigLIP 额外的 0.155 RSA 优势。\n      - Action probe R² ~0.695 与 SigLIP projector（0.706）接近但略低，说明 VL pretraining \n        的 contribution 主要在 geometric alignment（RSA）而非 raw information content（R²），\n        与 DINO ≈ Projector in R² 的发现一致。\n\n      此结果的 implication：\n      - Claim 1 必须限定：不是所有 VL-pretrained encoder 都达到 SigLIP 水平的 geometric \n        alignment。存在 encoder hierarchy：SigLIP > CLIP > DINO。\n      - 但核心论点不变：即使 RSA=0.46 的 CLIP-ViT，其 geometric alignment 仍高于 VLA \n        各条件（0.48-0.50 LLM degrades it further），且远高于 DINO。\n      - \"Pretraining recipe matters\" 是新增 discussion point，不是对 core claims 的否定。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 4: Pretraining Control — CLIP-ViT vs SigLIP vs DINO\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Encoder\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Pretraining\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP-SO400M\", \"0.615\", \"0.706\", \"Sigmoid image-text (WebLI)\"]\n          - [\"CLIP ViT-L/14\", \"0.46\", \"0.695\", \"Softmax image-text (WIT/LAION)\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 ViT-L\", \"0.388\", \"0.712\", \"Self-supervised (LVD-142M)\"]\n      - title: \"Table 4b: Decomposition of VL-pretraining contribution\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Comparison\", \"ΔRSA\", \"ΔR²\", \"Interpretation\"]\n          - [\"CLIP - DINO\", \"+0.072\", \"-0.017\", \"VL pretraining adds geometric alignment, not information\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP - CLIP\", \"+0.155\", \"+0.011\", \"SigLIP recipe adds both alignment and information\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP - DINO\", \"+0.227\", \"-0.006\", \"Total VL advantage is geometric, not functional\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: 2D scatter (RSA × R²)，三个 encoder 标注 + VLA 各条件，虚线标注 CLIP-ViT 的中间位置\"\n      - \"Figure 4b: Bar chart decomposing RSA gap: DINO→CLIP (+0.07) + CLIP→SigLIP (+0.155)\"\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP-ViT 中间结果在 median 档下是 double-edged sword：\n\n      正面：(1) 确认 VL pretraining 有贡献（CLIP > DINO in RSA），支撑 \"VL pretraining \n      matters\" 叙事。(2) R² 三者接近进一步强化 geometric-functional dissociation finding。\n      (3) 为 \"pretraining recipe matters\" discussion 提供具体数据点。\n\n      负面：(1) SigLIP 优势部分来自 encoder-specific 因素，削弱 \"VL pretraining is the key\" \n      的通用性声明。(2) 至少一位 reviewer 会质疑：如果换成 CLIP-ViT，VLA 的 action structure \n      会怎样变化？需要 rebuttal 准备 CLIP-ViT as VLA backbone 的讨论（即使不做实验）。\n\n      Rebuttal 策略：将 CLIP-ViT 结果定位为 \"partial support + new insight\"——VL pretraining \n      是 necessary but not sufficient condition for strong geometric alignment，SigLIP \n      recipe 的具体优势值得 future work 深入研究。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检查指标依赖性\"\n    expected_results:\n      linear_cka_ordering: \"untrained (0.089) > trained (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\"\n      rdm_cka_ordering: \"trained (0.260) ≈ projector (0.257) > untrained (0.246) > DINO (0.241)\"\n      cka_last_preaction: 0.127\n      rsa_cka_ordering_reversal: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成。在 median 档下此结果面临额外挑战：至少一位 reviewer 将 CKA-RSA dissociation \n      视为 metric confusion 而非 finding。\n\n      为什么 CKA 和 RSA 排序反转：\n      - RSA 测量 pairwise distance structure 的 rank correlation——local geometric alignment。\n        LLM 的 nonlinear transformation 打乱了 pairwise distances 的 rank order，降低 RSA。\n      - CKA 测量 centered kernel alignment——global subspace overlap。LLM 保留甚至增强了 \n        global variance structure（特别是 CKA 单调上升 L0→L32），因为 attention 操作虽然 \n        重排 pairwise distances 但保留了 principal variation directions。\n      - 这不是 \"metric confusion\"——两个指标测量不同 aspects of representational similarity，\n        dissociation 本身是 informative 的。但 median 档的 reviewer 可能不接受这个区分。\n\n      Rebuttal 准备：\n      - 明确定义 \"geometric alignment\" (RSA) vs \"structural preservation\" (CKA)\n      - 引用 Kornblith et al. 2019 和 Shahbazi et al. 2021 对两指标 sensitivity 差异的分析\n      - 强调 Claim 2 已限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"，不泛化为 \"representation quality\"\n      - CKA last_preaction=0.127 >> image_mean 0.08x 支撑 redistribution，与 RSA 一致\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S3: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Ordering\", \"Interpretation\"]\n          - [\"RSA\", \"Proj > Trained > Untrained > DINO\", \"Geometric alignment with action space\"]\n          - [\"Linear CKA\", \"Untrained > Trained > Proj > DINO\", \"Global structure preservation\"]\n          - [\"RDM-CKA\", \"Trained ≈ Proj > Untrained > DINO\", \"Hybrid (distance-based CKA)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure S2: 双 y-axis plot (RSA left, CKA right) across conditions, 标注 ordering reversal\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档下需在 main text Discussion 正面讨论此 dissociation（不能只放 supplementary）。\n      一位 reviewer 的 \"metric confusion\" 评价需正面回应：dissociation 恰恰说明 LLM 对 \n      representation 的变换是 selective 的——降解 local geometry 但保留 global structure——\n      这对理解 LLM 的 representation processing 有独立价值。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 benchmark 交叉验证所有 Claims\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.52\n      siglip_projector_rsa_95ci: [0.45, 0.58]\n      trained_image_mean_rsa_peak: 0.42\n      trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 19\n      untrained_image_mean_rsa_peak: 0.40\n      untrained_image_mean_peak_layer: 23\n      dino_rsa: 0.32\n      training_effect_delta: 0.02\n      training_effect_p: 0.08\n      training_effect_significant: false\n      readout_trained_R2: 0.68\n      readout_untrained_R2: 0.655\n      readout_delta: 0.025\n      readout_delta_ci: [0.015, 0.035]\n      readout_delta_p: 0.01\n      action_probe_projector_R2: 0.65\n      action_probe_llm_image_mean_R2: 0.62\n      ordering_preserved: true\n      effect_size_reduction: \"35-45%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：LIBERO-Spatial 未完成或部分复现，effect size 缩小 30-50%。\n\n      为什么 effect size 缩小：\n      - LIBERO-Spatial 的 action structure 比 LIBERO-Goal 更 spatially grounded——task \n        差异主要在 spatial prepositions（\"to the left of\", \"in front of\"）而非 object \n        identity。SigLIP 的 image-text pretraining 对 spatial relationships 的 encoding \n        不如对 object-level semantics 那么强，因此 RSA 从 0.615 降至 ~0.52。\n      - Training effect 在 LIBERO-Spatial 上 p=0.08（边缘），因为 spatial tasks 的 action \n        variability 更高，增加了 bootstrap sampling 的 variance。但 CI 仍然覆盖 0 或 \n        接近覆盖 0，不改变 Claim 3 的方向性结论。\n      - Readout concentration Δ=0.025（vs LIBERO-Goal 0.045）缩小约 44%，但仍显著 \n        (p=0.01)。缩小原因：spatial tasks 的 action prediction 难度更高，readout \n        concentration 的 ceiling effect 降低。\n      - DINO RSA 也降至 0.32（vs 0.388 on LIBERO-Goal），说明 spatial tasks 对所有 \n        encoder 都更难 align。\n\n      此结果的 implication：\n      - 所有三个 Claims 的 ordering 保持（SigLIP > VLA > DINO; trained ≈ untrained in \n        distributed; trained > untrained in readout），但 effect size 一致缩小。\n      - 论文需在所有 Claims 加 \"on LIBERO-Goal\" 限定，LIBERO-Spatial 作为 partial \n        replication 放在 supplementary 或 discussion。\n      - 如果 deadline 前未完成：rebuttal 中 promise LIBERO-Spatial 初步结果，附现有 \n        extraction pipeline 的进度证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table S4: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Condition\", \"RSA (Spatial)\", \"RSA (Goal)\", \"Reduction\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector\", \"0.52\", \"0.615\", \"-15%\"]\n          - [\"Trained image_mean\", \"0.42\", \"0.501\", \"-16%\"]\n          - [\"Untrained image_mean\", \"0.40\", \"0.485\", \"-18%\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2\", \"0.32\", \"0.388\", \"-18%\"]\n          - [\"Training Δ\", \"0.02 (p=0.08)\", \"0.02 (p=0.20)\", \"direction consistent\"]\n      - title: \"Table S5: Readout Concentration Cross-Benchmark\"\n        rows:\n          - [\"Metric\", \"Spatial\", \"Goal\", \"Reduction\"]\n          - [\"Trained readout R²\", \"0.68\", \"0.731\", \"-7%\"]\n          - [\"Untrained readout R²\", \"0.655\", \"0.686\", \"-5%\"]\n          - [\"Δ (trained-untrained)\", \"0.025\", \"0.045\", \"-44%\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.01\", \"<0.0001\", \"still significant\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure S3: Side-by-side bar charts LIBERO-Goal vs LIBERO-Spatial, 所有条件 paired comparison\"\n      - \"Figure S4: Readout concentration comparison across benchmarks with bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 部分复现在 median 档下是可接受的：ordering 保持证明 findings 非 \n      benchmark-specific artifact，effect size 缩小说明 task characteristics（spatial vs \n      object-centric）调节了具体 magnitude。这实际上增加了论文的 nuance 和 ecological \n      validity。\n\n      关键 rebuttal 点：effect size 缩小是 expected 的（spatial relationships 更难），\n      ordering preservation 才是 generalizability 的 test。如果连 ordering 都不保持 \n      那才是 real concern。\n\n      如果未完成：在 paper Discussion 加 \"ongoing cross-benchmark validation\" 一段，\n      rebuttal letter 提供 extraction pipeline 进度 + 初步 RSA numbers。Reviewer \n      通常接受 \"data in preparation\" 如果方向一致且 pipeline 可信。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b49b86d8-f392-4543-b156-991db6c9e895","total_cost_usd":0.46586025,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25961,"cache_read_input_tokens":49316,"output_tokens":10326,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25961,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":10171,"cache_read_input_tokens":37475,"cache_creation_input_tokens":327,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":327},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":20591,"outputTokens":38,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.020781,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":10326,"cacheReadInputTokens":49316,"cacheCreationInputTokens":25961,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.44507925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"83eac16a-c9f2-4444-968f-2b77457c7a1b"}
